 "brief": "Israeli occupation authorities ordered a British military team working in the West Bank to leave Palestinian occupied territories, Shehab Wire reported. The expulsion came as the team was preparing to expand its operational scope to monitor security conditions across the region and provide detailed assessments of the situation on the ground.\n\nThe timing of the Israeli order proved significant, arriving precisely when the British contingent had begun readying plans to widen its mandate and deepen its monitoring activities in the territory. No explanation was given for the expulsion order issued by Israeli authorities.",
